Usage:
  python3 scripts/gate.py <phase> [--yolo] [--skip-human]
  python3 scripts/gate.py validate-packets

Exit codes:
  0 — gate passed
  1 — gate failed (surfaceable issue, retry possible)
  2 — hard stop (never retried, never bypassed)
"""

